 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Layers",
   "items": [
    "Frontend: React/Vite web app plus a Demo Mode front door",
    "Backend: one FastAPI service (REST, SSE streams) on :8000",
    "Agents: Evidence Agent, InsightLens and Fit-Gap Copilot on a shared runtime",
    "RAG & knowledge graph: one Markdown corpus feeds both engines"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Model layer",
   "items": [
    "Ollama runs bge-m3 locally for embeddings — no text leaves for this",
    "Anthropic Claude writes answers, drives agent tool loops, judges and writes Cypher",
    "Hindsight reaches its LLM through LiteLLM"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Authentication & guardrails",
   "items": [
    "Sign-in is a presentation lock: HMAC-signed HttpOnly cookie on the pages",
    "/api stays open — run on localhost or behind a real auth proxy",
    "Guardrails: Haiku scope check, contact redaction on every response, allow-listed web search"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Observability & evaluation",
   "items": [
    "Langfuse traces every model-calling run (optional, off without keys)",
    "RAG: Ragas judges every answer + 27-question ground-truth experiments",
    "Agents: code-only scores from quote checks, gates, tools, guardrails",
    "Graph: structure checks and NL→Cypher execution accuracy, runs kept in Postgres"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Cross-check vs component-architecture.svg",
   "items": [
    "All components and layers confirmed in the repository",
    "Hindsight: code wires it to the Evidence Agent only; diagram shows it for all agents (planned)",
    "Not shown there: per-upload docling_session schema, knowledge_graph.json, optional vision models in ingestion, LiteLLM for Hindsight"
   ]
  }
 ]
}